WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.501
Peter ran toward the trash pile.

2
00:00:05.502 --> 00:00:16.333
So did Mopsy and Cotton-tail.

3
00:00:16.334 --> 00:00:23.961
Flopsy slowly hopped after them.

4
00:00:23.962 --> 00:00:28.725
She was worried about the farmer.

5
00:00:28.726 --> 00:00:32.070
Flopsy saw lots of trash.

6
00:00:32.071 --> 00:00:40.520
There were bags and pots and old boots.

7
00:00:40.521 --> 00:00:46.017
Peter sniffed the air.

8
00:00:46.018 --> 00:00:50.431
"I smell rotting vegetables!" he said.

9
00:00:50.432 --> 00:00:55.331
"I see lots of flies," said Cotton-tail.

10
00:00:55.332 --> 00:01:00.329
Suddenly the bunnies spotted something green.

11
00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:05.519
"Mmm!" cried Mopsy. "Lettuce!"

12
00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:15.631
"Peas!" cried Cotton-tail.

13
00:01:15.632 --> 00:01:23.287
"Come on, Flopsy. Let's eat!"

14
00:01:23.288 --> 00:01:30.239
Even Flopsy ate peas and lettuce.

15
00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:34.895
Soon the bunnies were very full.

16
00:01:34.896 --> 00:01:41.982
The sun felt very warm.

17
00:01:41.983 --> 00:01:50.432
Three bunnies fell asleep.

18
00:01:50.433 --> 00:01:53.783
Flopsy was tired too.

19
00:01:53.784 --> 00:01:56.634
But she could not sleep.

20
00:01:56.635 --> 00:01:59.914
She was worried about the farmer.

21
00:01:59.915 --> 00:02:04.282
And Mother was coming home soon.

22
00:02:04.283 --> 00:02:06.848
Bzz . . . Bzz . . .

23
00:02:06.849 --> 00:02:09.903
Flies buzzed around Flopsy's head.

24
00:02:09.904 --> 00:02:14.885
"Ugh!" Flopsy swatted the flies.

25
00:02:14.886 --> 00:02:19.768
Then Flopsy spotted a paper bag.

26
00:02:19.769 --> 00:02:22.622
She put the bag over her head.

27
00:02:22.623 --> 00:02:25.766
"Now the flies won't bother me.

28
00:02:25.767 --> 00:02:34.156
And soon we will go home."

29
00:02:34.157 --> 00:02:38.587
Suddenly Flopsy heard a sound.

30
00:02:38.588 --> 00:02:44.057
"Shh!" Mrs. Tittlemouse ran toward her.

31
00:02:44.058 --> 00:02:47.969
"You must hide!" the mouse whispered.

32
00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:54.565
"The farmer is coming!"

